a-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1686015929090"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>撥水機能はありながらレイングッズ特有の光沢感がなく、天候問わず羽織れます。</p><p>首元までボタンを留めれば風が強い日にも安心です。</p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054350458" data-id="1614054350458"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1658206841440" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1658206841440" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/d089ef82-1281-4d6b-bfc7-0df938915d30/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/DSC_3347%202.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1600" natural-height="1200" width="1600" height="1200"></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1680874389695" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1680874389695" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054348544" data-id="1614054348544"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1680874389649" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1680874389649" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/4b2ba0a0-7134-4f20-b6ee-7d99d9bb4299/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/DSC_3347%202.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1600" natural-height="1200" width="1600" height="1200"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-16140